Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:27.56,Hook,,0,0,0,,ESTE ALDEANO ME ESTÁ\NARRUINANDO LA VIDA
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.12,0:00:01.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}No, no, no sé qué quiere.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.72,0:00:04.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Estoy para matarlo ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.24,0:00:06.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿Qué busca?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.26,0:00:07.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿Cómo se escapa?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.96,0:00:09.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}No entiendo por qué se\Nescapa. Voy a traer otro.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.80,0:00:12.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Entrá y no te escapes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.20,0:00:16.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Me está…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.24,0:00:20.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}arruinando la vida. Estoy\Npor la puta…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.06,0:00:22.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Vamos, vamos, vamos,\Nvamos. No te
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.86,0:00:23.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}va a pasar nada.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.56,0:00:27.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Vení, pelotudo, vení.\NEntrá y no te escapes.
